'' BLOCK STRINGS (docs/tiko-strings RFC-0001), a tiko extension. '"""' opens one only when
'' nothing but whitespace follows it on its line, so '"""abc"""' and '""""' keep their fbc
'' meaning; the closer's indentation is the margin; blank lines are exempt from it; '"' and
'' '"""' inside a body need no escape; tokens after the closer are lexed as usual.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-tokens tests/lexer/src/block-strings.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-NOT: TKO02
'' GOLDEN: expected/block-strings.out
